---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import Artwork from '../../components/Artwork.astro';
---

<Base pageKey="service-crm-custom-systems">
<main>
<section data-hero="" data-pad="" style="position:relative;overflow:hidden;padding:110px 72px 90px;max-width:1440px;margin:0 auto">
  <div data-art-id="create-service-crm" data-art="create-service-crm" data-art-slot="" style="position:absolute;top:-120px;left:-200px;width:760px;height:760px;border-radius:40px;overflow:hidden;background:#0B0B0E;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.07);display:flex;align-items:flex-end;pointer-events:none"><Artwork id="create-service-crm" />
    <div data-art-note="" data-art-label="" style="position:absolute;left:0;top:0;box-sizing:border-box;display:flex;padding:14px 18px;border-radius:12px;background:rgba(9,9,11,.82);border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.14);flex-direction:column;gap:6px;max-width:520px">
      <span style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8B5CF6">ARTWORK — CRM &amp; CUSTOM SYSTEMS</span>
      <span style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:9.5px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#71717A">Artwork Placeholder</span>
      <span style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:11px;line-height:1.6;color:#52525B">4:5 desktop · 1:1 tablet · 1:1 mobile · separate mobile render required</span>
      <span style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:10.5px;line-height:1.6;color:#3F3F46">Final artwork supplied separately</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div style="position:relative;z-index:2;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:22px;max-width:760px;margin-left:auto;text-align:left">
    <div style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8B5CF6">CRM &amp; custom systems</div>
    <h1 data-h1="" style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:64px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.035em;line-height:1.03">When off-the-shelf software stops fitting, we design around you.</h1>
    <p data-lead="" style="margin:0;font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:#A1A1AA;max-width:600px">Disconnected spreadsheets, repetitive manual entry, information scattered across tools, a process nobody has written down. Create Studio designs CRM platforms and custom systems around the workflows, users and objectives that already exist.</p>
    <p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;color:#52525B;max-width:600px">Every system is individually scoped. Features follow the approved requirements, third-party integrations may carry their own costs, and CRM &amp; Custom Systems always use a Custom Quote — there is no fixed package or automatic price.</p>
    <div data-row="" style="display:flex;gap:14px;margin-top:8px"><a href="/contact?service=crm-custom-systems" data-route="contact" data-btn-primary="" style="padding:16px 30px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#2563FF,#8B5CF6,#2563FF);font-weight:600;font-size:15px;transition:transform .25s ease,box-shadow .25s ease;text-align:center" data-sh="5">Start a Project</a><a href="/pricing" data-route="pricing" data-btn-ghost="" style="padding:16px 30px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.16);font-weight:500;font-size:15px;transition:background .25s ease,border-color .25s ease;text-align:center" data-sh="6">Compare Website Packages</a></div>
  </div>
</section>
<section data-sect="" data-pad="" style="max-width:1440px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 72px 100px;"><div data-cols="" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.15fr;gap:70px;align-items:start">
  <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px"><div style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8B5CF6">The problem</div><h2 data-h2="" data-rv="" style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:38px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.03em;line-height:1.1">The information exists. It lives in nine places.</h2></div>
  <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px"><p style="margin:0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.8;color:#A1A1AA">Leads in an inbox, clients in a spreadsheet, the calendar on someone’s phone, commissions worked out by hand at month end. Each part is defensible. Together they cost hours a week and obscure the numbers decisions depend on.</p><p style="margin:0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.8;color:#A1A1AA">Generic platforms solve part of it and ask you to change how you work for the rest. A custom system runs the other way round.</p></div>
</div></section>
<section data-sect="" data-pad="" style="max-width:1440px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 72px 100px;"><div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:30px;padding:48px;border-radius:28px;background:#0B0B0E;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.08)">
  <div data-row="" style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end;gap:30px">
    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;max-width:640px"><div style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8B5CF6">Our solution</div><h2 data-h2="" data-rv="" style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:36px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.03em;line-height:1.12">Map the work, then build to the map.</h2><p style="margin:0;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.8;color:#A1A1AA">The real workflow comes first — who does what, in what order, with which information. Then the modules that matter get designed and built, existing tools get integrated, and role-based access gives each person exactly the view they need.</p></div>
  </div>
  <div data-cols="" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:10px 32px;padding-top:26px;border-top:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.08)"><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Dashboards</span></div>
  <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Contact databases</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Lead and buyer pipelines</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Calendars</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Commissions</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Financial tracking</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Reports and business intelligence</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Workflow automation</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Custom portals</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Third-party integrations</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Role-based access</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Ongoing system improvements</span></div></div>
  <p style="margin:0;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.8;color:#52525B;max-width:760px">These are examples of functions a custom system can include. They are not automatically included in every project — each system is scoped around the functions your business actually requires, and inclusions are documented in the custom proposal.</p>
  <div style="font-size:13px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.7">AI-supported tools are added only where they genuinely improve a workflow — never as a feature for its own sake.</div>
</div></section>
<section data-sect="" data-pad="" style="max-width:1440px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 72px 100px;"><div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:26px"><div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px"><div style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8B5CF6">How the work runs</div><h2 data-h2="" data-rv="" style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:34px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.03em">Longer than a website, and phased accordingly.</h2></div><div data-cols="" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:16px"><div style="padding:24px;border-radius:18px;background:#0E0E12;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.08);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px"><div style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:11px;color:#8B5CF6">01</div><h3 style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:16.5px;font-weight:600">Process mapping</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:12.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6">How the work runs today, end to end.</p></div><div style="padding:24px;border-radius:18px;background:#0E0E12;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.08);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px"><div style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:11px;color:#8B5CF6">02</div><h3 style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:16.5px;font-weight:600">System design</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:12.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6">Modules, data model, roles and permissions.</p></div><div style="padding:24px;border-radius:18px;background:#0E0E12;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.08);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px"><div style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:11px;color:#8B5CF6">03</div><h3 style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:16.5px;font-weight:600">Build</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:12.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6">Core modules first, tested with real data.</p></div><div style="padding:24px;border-radius:18px;background:#0E0E12;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.08);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px"><div style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:11px;color:#8B5CF6">04</div><h3 style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:16.5px;font-weight:600">Rollout</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:12.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6">Migration, training and adjustment.</p></div><div style="padding:24px;border-radius:18px;background:#0E0E12;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.08);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px"><div style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:11px;color:#8B5CF6">05</div><h3 style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:16.5px;font-weight:600">Improve</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:12.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6">Iterations as the operation changes.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section data-sect="" data-pad="" style="max-width:1440px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 72px 100px;"><div data-cols="" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:24px">
  <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;padding:40px;border-radius:26px;background:#0E0E12;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.08)">
    <div style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8B5CF6">What you get</div>
    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:11px;margin-top:4px"><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>One place for contacts, deals and activity</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Pipelines that reflect your actual sales stages</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Reports built from real data, not manual entry</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Automations that remove repetitive admin</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Access control per role</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>A system that can grow with new modules</span></div></div>
  </div>
  <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px"><a href="/work/custom-real-estate-crm" data-route="work-custom-real-estate-crm" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;padding:16px;border-radius:26px;background:#0E0E12;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.08);transition:border-color .3s ease" data-sh="16"><div style="position:relative;height:300px;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;background:radial-gradient(120% 140% at 22% 12%,rgba(37,99,255,.14),rgba(9,9,11,0) 62%),#0B0B0E;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.07);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;"><div style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.8;padding:0 16px">Custom Real Estate CRM</div></div><div style="padding:6px 10px 10px"><div style="font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:19px;font-weight:600">Custom Real Estate CRM</div><div style="font-size:13px;color:#A1A1AA;margin-top:6px;line-height:1.6">A centralized real-estate system for managing opportunities, buyer pipelines, calendars, commissions, reporting and business intelligence.</div><div style="font-size:12.5px;color:#8B5CF6;margin-top:10px">View Case Study <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></div></div></a></div>
</div></section>
<section data-sect="" data-pad="" style="max-width:1440px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 72px 100px;"><div data-cols="" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.15fr 1fr;gap:40px;align-items:center;padding:44px;border-radius:26px;background:#0B0B0E;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.08)">
   <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px"><div style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8B5CF6">Pricing</div><h2 data-h2="" data-rv="" style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:34px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.03em;line-height:1.12">Custom Quote<!--/h2--><p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.75;max-width:560px">Based on the approved features, workflows, users, integrations, data requirements, infrastructure and overall system complexity. Your system will be scoped around the functions your business actually requires. Features are confirmed during discovery and documented in the custom proposal.</p></h2></div>
   <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px"><a href="/contact?service=crm-custom-systems" data-route="contact" data-btn-primary="" style="padding:16px 30px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#2563FF,#8B5CF6,#2563FF);font-weight:600;font-size:15px;transition:transform .25s ease,box-shadow .25s ease;text-align:center" data-sh="5">Request a Custom Quote</a><a href="/contact?service=crm-custom-systems" data-route="contact" data-btn-ghost="" style="padding:16px 30px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.16);font-weight:500;font-size:15px;transition:background .25s ease,border-color .25s ease;text-align:center" data-sh="6">Tell Us About Your Project</a></div>
 </div>
  <div style="margin-top:20px;padding:28px 32px;border-radius:22px;background:#0B0B0E;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.08)">
    <h3 style="margin:0 0 10px;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:600">Infrastructure and ownership</h3>
    <p style="margin:0;font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.8;color:#A1A1AA">If a dedicated domain, subdomain, hosting environment, cloud account, database or storage account is required, ownership and billing responsibilities are defined in the proposal. Where technically possible, client-specific infrastructure accounts are created under your legal name or business identity. Create Studio’s access is administrative access for implementation and management — not ownership of your operational infrastructure.</p>
  </div></section>
<section data-sect="" data-pad="" style="max-width:1440px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 72px 100px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:22px">
  <div style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8B5CF6">Related services</div>
  <div data-cols="" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px">
    <a href="/services/web-design-development" data-route="service-web-design-development" style="padding:26px;border-radius:20px;background:#0E0E12;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.08);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:9px;transition:border-color .3s ease,transform .3s ease" data-sh="15"><h3 style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:600">Web Design &amp; Development</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:13px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6">The primary service. Landing pages, corporate sites, catalogs, portfolios and multilingual platforms — each one designed and built from scratch for the business behind it.</p><span style="font-size:12.5px;color:#8B5CF6;margin-top:4px">Explore →</span></a><a href="/services/website-redesign" data-route="service-website-redesign" style="padding:26px;border-radius:20px;background:#0E0E12;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.08);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:9px;transition:border-color .3s ease,transform .3s ease" data-sh="15"><h3 style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:600">Website Redesign</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:13px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6">Keep what works, rethink what doesn’t — structure, usability and visual presentation reviewed together.</p><span style="font-size:12.5px;color:#8B5CF6;margin-top:4px">Explore →</span></a><a href="/services/seo-performance" data-route="service-seo-performance" style="padding:26px;border-radius:20px;background:#0E0E12;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.08);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:9px;transition:border-color .3s ease,transform .3s ease" data-sh="15"><h3 style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:600">SEO &amp; Performance</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:13px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6">Visibility is built, not bought: technical foundations, content structure and steady monitoring, reviewed month after month.</p><span style="font-size:12.5px;color:#8B5CF6;margin-top:4px">Explore →</span></a>
  </div>
</section>
<section data-sect="" data-pad="" style="position:relative;overflow:hidden;padding:130px 72px;text-align:center;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:24px">
  <div data-art-id="create-contact-expansion" data-art="create-contact-expansion" data-art-slot="" style="position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);width:860px;height:860px;border-radius:50%;overflow:hidden;background:#0B0B0E;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.07);display:flex;align-items:flex-end;pointer-events:none"><Artwork id="create-contact-expansion" />
    <div data-art-note="" data-art-label="" style="position:absolute;left:0;top:0;box-sizing:border-box;display:flex;padding:14px 18px;border-radius:12px;background:rgba(9,9,11,.82);border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.14);flex-direction:column;gap:6px;max-width:520px">
      <span style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8B5CF6">ARTWORK — CONTACT</span>
      <span style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:9.5px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#71717A">Artwork Placeholder</span>
      <span style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:11px;line-height:1.6;color:#52525B">1:1 centred · core 40% reserved for headline · no internal shape animation</span>
      <span style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:10.5px;line-height:1.6;color:#3F3F46">Final artwork supplied separately</span>
    </div>
  </div>
